# Standalone nested-X test recipe derived from the frozen fixture.
# These bootstrap palette/font commands affect shared desktop roles; use the
# installed example alone for normal local.config customization.
Read "$[FVWM_DATADIR]/default-config/lucide-menus.fvwm"
MenuStyle * Font "xft:Sans:size=11", HilightBack, ActiveFore
Colorset 5 fg #e5edf0, bg #202a31
Colorset 6 fg #122128, bg #63b7bb
Colorset 7 fg #a8b6be, bg #202a31
Colorset 8 fg #63b7bb, bg #202a31
FVWMXLucideSetup
Popup FVWMXLucideExamples
